ters. They're responsible for the design, development, operation, and long-term evolution of the systems they build. Success in this role is measured by production outcomes, engineering judgment, and the ability to deliver durable, scalable solutions that create customer value.",{"type":112,"tag":121,"props":1002,"children":1003},{},[1004],{"type":118,"value":1005},"This is a genuinely AI-first engineering role, fitting for a company whose own product is built on AI. AI-assisted development is a core competency here, not an optional productivity tool. You'll use AI throughout the full software development lifecycle, technical design, implementation planning, coding, testing, debugging, documentation, and operational analysis. As the company continues to evolve its AI-first engineering platform, you'll also design, build, and maintain AI agents that automate engineering workflows and power product capabilities.",{"type":112,"tag":121,"props":1007,"children":1008},{},[1009],{"type":118,"value":467},{"type":112,"tag":148,"props":1011,"children":1012},{},[1013,1018,1023,1028,1033,1038,1043,1048,1053],{"type":112,"tag":152,"props":1014,"children":1015},{},[1016],{"type":118,"value":1017},"Own systems end-to-end and remain accountable for their behavior in production.",{"type":112,"tag":152,"props":1019,"children":1020},{},[1021],{"type":118,"value":1022},"Monitor, support, and continuously improve the systems you own well beyond initial deployment.",{"type":112,"tag":152,"props":1024,"children":1025},{},[1026],{"type":118,"value":1027},"Make thoughtful technical decisions, balance competing priorities, and understand the long-term impact of your work.",{"type":112,"tag":152,"props":1029,"children":1030},{},[1031],{"type":118,"value":1032},"Treat AI as a core part of the engineering workflow, leveraging AI agents throughout the development lifecycle while maintaining complete ownership and accountability for every decision and line of code.",{"type":112,"tag":152,"props":1034,"children":1035},{},[1036],{"type":118,"value":1037},"Design scalable distributed systems and microservice architectures.",{"type":112,"tag":152,"props":1039,"children":1040},{},[1041],{"type":118,"value":1042},"Debug, troubleshoot, and support production systems.",{"type":112,"tag":152,"props":1044,"children":1045},{},[1046],{"type":118,"value":1047},"Balance speed, quality, scalability, and maintainability.",{"type":112,"tag":152,"props":1049,"children":1050},{},[1051],{"type":118,"value":1052},"Design, build, and integrate AI agents and agentic workflows to automate engineering tasks and solve product challenges.",{"type":112,"tag":152,"props":1054,"children":1055},{},[1056],{"type":118,"value":1057},"Mentor peers through technical leadership and code reviews.",{"type":112,"tag":121,"props":1059,"children":1060},{},[1061],{"type":118,"value":1062},"Availability: Full-time.",{"type":112,"tag":113,"props":1064,"children":1065},{"id":194},[1066],{"type":118,"value":197},{"type":112,"tag":199,"props":1068,"children":1069},{},[1070,1074,1078,1082],{"type":112,"tag":152,"props":1071,"children":1072},{},[1073],{"type":118,"value":206},{"type":112,"tag":152,"props":1075,"children":1076},{},[1077],{"type":118,"value":211},{"type":112,"tag":152,"props":1079,"children":1080},{},[1081],{"type":118,"value":216},{"type":112,"tag":152,"props":1083,"children":1084},{},[1085],{"type":118,"value":221},{"type":112,"tag":113,"props":1087,"children":1088},{"id":224},[1089],{"type":118,"value":227},{"type":112,"tag":148,"props":1091,"children":1092},{},[1093,1098,1103,1108,1113,1118,1123,1128,1133,1138],{"type":112,"tag":152,"props":1094,"children":1095},{},[1096],{"type":118,"value":1097},"Upper intermediate to fluent speaking and writing English.",{"type":112,"tag":152,"props":1099,"children":1100},{},[1101],{"type":118,"value":1102},"5+ years of experience building backend applications with Python and FastAPI or similar framework.",{"type":112,"tag":152,"props":1104,"children"